{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/9e1acd243723cd9f87ff73d7880bae8f.avif?t=1765603177\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultivate Your Garden And Mind</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend to a garden that tickles your brain and satisfies your senses with tactile, organic sounds and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a game of logic, luck, and pattern recognition. After flowers grow at random, prune them away to ensure there are no two of the same flower in any row, column, or quadrant. Harvest at the end of each round to collect points and grow your high score.\u00a0 Master new challenges presented in each round as you watch your gardens flourish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your mind sharp with a game that can fill the gaps in your day.\u00a0 With no time pressure, you\u2019re free to grow your gardens with care at a comfortable pace.\u00a0 Primrows offers endless replayability and new variety each week \u2014 perfect for players looking for a new daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fresh Ways to Play And Weekly Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/334f2ea1624d33af49f091412527af1e.poster.avif?t=1765603177\" width=800 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/334f2ea1624d33af49f091412527af1e.webm?t=1765603177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/334f2ea1624d33af49f091412527af1e.mp4?t=1765603177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest as many points as you can in Quick Play or enjoy the more advanced Journal Play that rewards you for meeting certain criteria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t get enough? Anticipate each Weekly Challenge that introduces special flowers and tiles that change the gameplay. Celebrate holidays and other milestones with themed challenges and festive artwork to get you in the spirit of the season.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lose Yourself In Thought (And Nature)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/676afc4d9c47b50882e6f9106950f2e5.poster.avif?t=1765603177\" width=800 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/676afc4d9c47b50882e6f9106950f2e5.webm?t=1765603177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/676afc4d9c47b50882e6f9106950f2e5.mp4?t=1765603177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primrows combines elements from sudoku and board games into an approachable and novel puzzle challenge that invites you to play at your own pace.\u00a0 With a high skill ceiling and plenty of depth, gameplay offers a challenging and versatile experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in ambient music and hand-painted backgrounds that change with each season. Primrows features award-winning visuals that invite you to settle in and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/0be7952a42f798cca07ce828165855ae.avif?t=1765603177\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch that puzzle itch with Quick Play or enjoy deep strategy with Journal Play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly challenges to expand your gardening expertise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance strategy, chance, and pattern recognition with no time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive ambient soundscape inspired by nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerful artwork that changes with the seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinitely replayable with a high skill ceiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digestible for players of all skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility for color blindness and low vision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903530/extras/7196a1fdb1c0b379c59b45e692bf5b5f.avif?t=1765603177\" width=615 height=224 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Journal Prize","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903530/90491d0e368dfdf838fc2d3fe9ea7780e0f77007.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Prize","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903530/d3a7aa6766d55cffd40036fbf8b49d10065aea99.jpg"},{"name":"Journal Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903530/b5bef3699e0ed28d18c0a88385d440fc3e815757.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903530/02d255090efafd9765c09230aa1794ec4cadf9a5.jpg"},{"name":"Cut And Come Again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903530/a6dd3e84cb370c77514c45e3b3c46b297cb04d6e.jpg"},{"name":"Conservation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/290353